595
00:42:23,062 --> 00:42:25,280
Rym: I really like the smell of mercury and cadmium.

596
00:42:25,880 --> 00:42:26,261
Scott: Yeah, it's like.

597
00:42:26,281 --> 00:42:28,125
Scott: I haven't seen either way.

598
00:42:29,988 --> 00:42:35,660
Scott: I haven't seen information that says, ah yes, this fragrance gave people cancer, but I haven't seen the opposite either.

599
00:42:36,181 --> 00:42:49,220
